#: ../../source/cad_resources/ptc/ptc.rst:2
msgid "PTC CAD Resources"
msgstr "PTC CAD リソース"

#: ../../source/cad_resources/ptc/ptc.rst:4
msgid ""
"PTC is proud to join forces with *FIRST* to empower the engineers and "
"innovators of tomorrow! Through PTC Education, teams can gain free "
"software and services, including Onshape, Creo, Mathcad, Windchill, and "
"Vuforia, easy-to-use training curriculum, and financial grants to select "
"teams. PTC's product development software will enable collaboration, "
"increase efficiency, and enhance accuracy during the robot design "
"process."
msgstr ""
"PTC は *FIRST* と力を合わせて明日のエンジニアとイノベーターを支援できることを誇りに思います！"
"PTC Education を通じて、チームは Onshape、Creo、Mathcad、Windchill、Vuforia を含む"
"無償のソフトウェアとサービス、使いやすいトレーニングカリキュラム、および選ばれたチームへの"
"資金助成を得ることができます。PTC の製品開発ソフトウェアはロボット設計プロセス中の"
"コラボレーション、効率、精度を向上させます。"

#: ../../source/cad_resources/ptc/ptc.rst:12
msgid "Obtaining PTC Software"
msgstr "PTC ソフトウェアの入手方法"

#: ../../source/cad_resources/ptc/ptc.rst:14
msgid ""
"PTC makes software available to all *FIRST* teams via their *FIRST* `PTC "
"Student Download Page "
"<https://www.ptc.com/en/education/student/first>`__."
msgstr ""
"PTC は *FIRST* の `PTC Student Download ページ "
"<https://www.ptc.com/en/education/student/first>`__ を通じて"
"すべての *FIRST* チームにソフトウェアを提供しています。"

#: ../../source/cad_resources/ptc/ptc.rst:17
msgid ""
"PTC's cloud-based CAD tool, `OnShape <https://www.onshape.com/en/>`__, "
"merely requires a `FREE Education account "
"<https://www.onshape.com/en/education/>`__ available to all *FIRST* teams"
" (each student/mentor on the team needs their own account, "
"mentors/coaches should sign up as an \"Educator\"). Once you're signed up"
" for a free account, ALL of `PTC's OnShape training materials "
"<https://learn.onshape.com/>`__ are now available through the OnShape "
"login. PTC also `provides access to their desktop-based CAD tool, Creo "
"<https://www.ptc.com/en/products/education/free-software/standalone-"
"educator>`__, free to *FIRST* teams."
msgstr ""
"PTC のクラウドベース CAD ツール `OnShape <https://www.onshape.com/en/>`__ は、"
"すべての *FIRST* チームが利用できる `無料の教育アカウント "
"<https://www.onshape.com/en/education/>`__ があれば利用できます"
"（チームの各生徒・メンターは個別のアカウントが必要で、メンター・コーチは「Educator」として登録してください）。"
"無料アカウントに登録すると、OnShape ログインを通じて `PTC の OnShape トレーニング資料 "
"<https://learn.onshape.com/>`__ がすべて利用可能になります。"
"PTC はまた `デスクトップベース CAD ツール Creo "
"<https://www.ptc.com/en/products/education/free-software/standalone-"
"educator>`__ への無料アクセスも *FIRST* チームに提供しています。"

